1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,620
Hindun bila sebut mencuri, eh ini.

2
00:00:08,040 --> 00:00:09,491
Ya Rasulullah, inna Aba Sufyan

3
00:00:09,491 --> 00:00:11,221
rajulun syahih, fa hal 'alayya haraj

4
00:00:11,221 --> 00:00:12,170
an asaba min malihi?

5
00:00:12,170 --> 00:00:12,840
Sesungguhnya Abu Sufyan seorang yang

6
00:00:12,840 --> 00:00:14,040
bakhil,

7
00:00:14,418 --> 00:00:17,280
adakah aku bersalah jika aku

8
00:00:17,280 --> 00:00:19,140
mengambil sedikit daripada hartanya?

9
00:00:22,640 --> 00:00:23,830
Macam mana pula?

10
00:00:25,170 --> 00:00:27,599
Tengah bai'ah satu-satu, hai, Hindun

11
00:00:27,599 --> 00:00:28,514
menyampuk.

12
00:00:28,514 --> 00:00:30,030
Nabi kata hendaklah kamu berjanji

13
00:00:30,030 --> 00:00:31,900
bahawa tak boleh mencuri.

14
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:33,740
Eh, tak boleh mencuri pula.

15
00:00:34,460 --> 00:00:35,460
Macam mana ni?

16
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:38,410
Abu Sufyan, laki aku ni kedekut.

17
00:00:38,915 --> 00:00:40,115
Kedekut,

18
00:00:40,620 --> 00:00:43,660
jadi tak bagi nafkah pada aku.

19
00:00:45,360 --> 00:00:47,220
Lantas Abu Sufyan menjawab, malu

20
00:00:47,220 --> 00:00:48,810
pula laki ni.

21
00:00:50,420 --> 00:00:53,350
Wa ma asabti fahuwa laki halal.

22
00:00:53,350 --> 00:00:54,550
Halal.

23
00:00:56,740 --> 00:00:58,110
Apa yang kamu ambil tu semuanya

24
00:00:58,110 --> 00:01:01,115
halal, kata Abu Sufyan.

25
00:01:01,115 --> 00:01:03,000
Isteri dia cakap macam tu kan,

26
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:03,960
malulah dia.

27
00:01:04,440 --> 00:01:07,100
Yang kamu ambil tu aku halalkan.

28
00:01:09,620 --> 00:01:13,460
Jadi memang isteri boleh ambil harta

29
00:01:13,460 --> 00:01:16,580
suami, syaratnya suami kedekut.

30
00:01:18,460 --> 00:01:20,460
Kalau suami tak kedekut tak boleh ambil.

31
00:01:21,640 --> 00:01:24,052
Nabi kata, khuzi ma yakfiki

32
00:01:24,470 --> 00:01:26,132
wa waladaki.

33
00:01:27,011 --> 00:01:28,211
Ambillah

34
00:01:28,860 --> 00:01:31,960
untuk keperluanmu wa waladaki, dan

35
00:01:31,960 --> 00:01:33,160
anak-anakmu.

36
00:01:35,780 --> 00:01:38,370
Kedekut, tangkai jering laki.

37
00:01:40,100 --> 00:01:41,880
Duduk di rumah tak ada, tak

38
00:01:41,880 --> 00:01:43,490
bagi, kedekut.

39
00:01:47,260 --> 00:01:48,240
Boleh ambil.

40
00:01:48,240 --> 00:01:50,480
Untuk keperluan kamu dan anak-anakmu

41
00:01:50,480 --> 00:01:51,460
kena ambil.

42
00:01:52,720 --> 00:01:54,330
Tapi kalau laki dah tanggung elok,

43
00:01:54,330 --> 00:01:56,140
tak bolehlah ambil.
